WEBVTT

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:41.970
Maihama, FIGHT! FIGHT! FIGHT!

00:01:42.270 --> 00:01:45.140
Look at it. So peaceful.

00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:49.370
The situation in the real world
isn't feeding back into here now.

00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:52.520
We've lost the link with
the Oceanus, haven't we?

00:01:52.520 --> 00:01:54.850
I wonder how the battle's going.

00:01:55.290 --> 00:01:59.020
If only it wasn't out of Q.L.,
the Hraesvelg could be out there, too.

00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:01.390
There's still hope.

00:02:02.090 --> 00:02:06.930
If Kyo and the others successfully
make contact with Shima's original.

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:11.870
But even if they manage
to get the resurrection system,

00:02:11.870 --> 00:02:14.530
without the Oceanus,
we can't take it back to Earth.

00:02:14.870 --> 00:02:17.580
Even if they just get
the plans for the system,

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:20.280
we can transfer them
into the Zegapain's server.

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:24.020
Then we could construct it
in the factory on Earth!

00:02:24.020 --> 00:02:25.820
Factory...

00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:28.220
You mean where the Oceanus
and the Zegas were built?

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:31.610
But then, what about
the Maihama server?

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:35.690
There's no way the Zega
can hold this much data.

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:41.630
Unfortunately, we and this city
are stuck inside of G-Phaetus.

00:02:52.910 --> 00:02:53.850
What?!

00:03:01.690 --> 00:03:03.240
Our armor can't take any more!

00:03:06.520 --> 00:03:08.620
<i>Hang on, Lu-shen!</i>

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:11.990
Kyo...

00:03:16.870 --> 00:03:18.930
It's useless, lightless one!

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:21.940
Your ass is MINE!

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:38.010
I'm ready for you!

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:39.710
What?!

00:03:42.990 --> 00:03:45.760
See that?!
That's the power of layered Q.L.!

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:47.600
Kyo! The Garuda!

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:53.260
May-yu... Thank you.

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:07.710
LU-SHEN!

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:15.360
The Q.L. layering process...
The meta-body repair program... Holy!

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:18.160
And this is the resurrection system!

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:22.070
The final gift to us
from Commander Shima...

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:27.840
The Maihama server's holo-memory has been
greatly miniaturized using Gards-orm technology.

00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:30.840
Is it possible with this to?!

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:31.740
Forget it.

00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:33.240
What's wrong?

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:37.720
The resurrection system uses a lot
of technology that's unknown to us.

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:40.280
It'll take years to analyze it.

00:04:40.790 --> 00:04:43.420
Even if we get back
to Earth with this data...

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:46.150
We wouldn't be able to build it yet.

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:53.620
Bastard! How dare you!

00:04:55.030 --> 00:04:56.130
Abyss!

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:59.470
Rebirth is no longer an option for us!

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:08.880
Where'd he go?!

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:12.440
I can't read it anywhere!

00:05:13.050 --> 00:05:15.040
<i>Well done, both of you.</i>

00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:22.950
Sis! Lu-shen!

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:25.860
Who transferred them here?

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:28.170
We did, Vice-Commander Minato.

00:05:28.170 --> 00:05:30.400
Tarbo! You're all right?

00:05:32.740 --> 00:05:34.100
Look!

00:05:37.180 --> 00:05:39.080
Quantum weaponry detected
inside of the server!

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:43.910
It's him! The Mindi!

00:05:45.020 --> 00:05:49.210
- Huh? What's that?
- Mm? Something's flying up there.

00:05:52.190 --> 00:05:55.760
<i>They've transferred themselves</i>
<i>into the Maihama server.</i>

00:05:55.760 --> 00:05:57.700
Into Maihama?!

00:05:57.700 --> 00:05:59.800
<i>Naga wishes it so.</i>

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:03.490
But how?! You can't bring quantum
weaponry into the server!

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:06.530
<i>It's aliased as</i>
<i>anti-meta-body weaponry.</i>

00:06:07.310 --> 00:06:11.280
<i>The Oceanus is now</i>
<i>under G-Phaetus's control!</i>

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:12.380
What?!

00:06:12.380 --> 00:06:16.870
<i>To put it simply,</i>
<i>we've all been taken over!</i>

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:22.820
Should we destroy this place?

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:24.950
That is Naga's will.

00:06:40.140 --> 00:06:42.800
Oh, hell! We just lost
8 meta-bodies in those hits!

00:06:43.310 --> 00:06:46.770
They've been completely deleted from
the server! No chance of salvage!

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:49.450
Can't we use the system
to expel the Mindi?!

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:53.650
I'm trying, but we never anticipated
server invasion by outsiders!

00:06:57.990 --> 00:07:03.190
<i>Now, we have merged with</i>
<i>G- Phaetus, the equivalent of Naga.</i>

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:07.190
Damn you, this isn't fair!
Send us into Maihama, too!

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:10.170
<i>Oh, we intend to.</i>

00:07:10.170 --> 00:07:12.690
Naga also desires that.

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:18.300
Quantum modification of Altair, complete.
Downloading into Maihama server.

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:28.350
What is that?!

00:07:28.350 --> 00:07:30.760
It's an enemy Gards-orm mech!

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:33.690
That's crazy!
We've never seen anything like that thing!

00:07:33.690 --> 00:07:35.420
Wait, you mean from the game?!

00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:38.360
No... This is no game.

00:07:43.840 --> 00:07:47.070
The lightless ones
are all gathered over there!

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:49.470
We'll delete all of them.

00:07:52.810 --> 00:07:54.300
It's coming this way!

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:07.980
DIE WHERE YOU STAND!

00:08:13.830 --> 00:08:15.060
Altair!

00:08:17.940 --> 00:08:19.170
Zegapain!

00:08:19.170 --> 00:08:20.470
It <i>is</i> Zegapain!

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:23.940
Look! Up there!

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:25.100
Sogoru!

00:08:25.340 --> 00:08:26.880
It's Kyo!

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:28.080
Him?!

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:29.170
Ryoko!

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:31.750
We love this place...

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:33.510
And we won't forgive you for smashing it!

00:08:40.990 --> 00:08:44.860
<i>20 Ulvorfuls, now aliased!</i>
<i>5 Aanvals, now aliased!</i>

00:08:44.860 --> 00:08:46.590
<i>We just sent them over to you!</i>

00:08:46.930 --> 00:08:49.800
<i>Better finish them off fast,</i>
<i>or else you're all gonna get deleted!</i>

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:52.830
Not good!

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:14.260
The vice-president...

00:09:14.260 --> 00:09:15.690
Kuroshio...

00:09:15.690 --> 00:09:17.320
Isn't that Irie?

00:09:18.100 --> 00:09:19.720
Shizuno-sempai...

00:09:20.230 --> 00:09:23.500
This is our city. Our school!

00:09:23.940 --> 00:09:25.490
And we're going to defend it!

00:09:29.970 --> 00:09:32.270
Everyone, evacuate to the gymnasium!

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:36.180
Leave the student
evacuations to us! You guys...

00:09:36.850 --> 00:09:38.450
Help Sogoru.

00:09:38.450 --> 00:09:40.280
Everyone, this way! Hurry!

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:45.310
You guys!

00:09:46.820 --> 00:09:48.130
Wait!

00:09:48.130 --> 00:09:49.630
Leave them to me.

00:09:49.630 --> 00:09:50.390
Please.

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:56.190
Cool! It's for real!

00:10:07.650 --> 00:10:08.770
Kyo...

00:10:08.980 --> 00:10:10.910
Huh?! And my sister?!

00:10:12.280 --> 00:10:15.090
Koji! Run for it, you idiot!

00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:18.890
I didn't expect protecting them
while fighting would be this hard!

00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:39.480
We've done a pinpoint
enhancement of the gym's security!

00:10:39.480 --> 00:10:41.450
We're safe in here!

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:54.720
The gateway's closed.
The enemy can't get in here now.

00:10:55.030 --> 00:10:57.300
Whoa! Look!

00:10:57.300 --> 00:11:00.200
The Earth?!
There are that many deutera zones now?!

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:02.600
The entire Earth will be
covered with them in 12 hours!

00:11:03.030 --> 00:11:05.600
<i>It'd be easier to just</i>
<i>let them swallow you up.</i>

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:08.730
<i>That's what the deutera zones</i>
<i>were created for.</i>

00:11:09.370 --> 00:11:11.480
<i>They're automatons which rewrite...</i>

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:14.600
<i>the quantum data they</i>
<i>swallow into a form without pain.</i>

00:11:15.050 --> 00:11:18.810
<i>It's so that we can eventually produce</i>
<i>various types of ecosystems.</i>

00:11:23.250 --> 00:11:27.210
<i>Thanks to you, we've</i>
<i>evolved like Abyss and Sin have.</i>

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:28.550
Shut up!

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:35.990
<i>But it's true that our battle with</i>
<i>Cerebrum spurred our evolution.</i>

00:11:36.770 --> 00:11:40.460
<i>That's why we're having</i>
<i>you fight us, even now.</i>

00:11:43.270 --> 00:11:45.710
<i>Oceanus! Oceanus, do you read?</i>

00:11:46.740 --> 00:11:50.650
<i>We're currently engaging</i>
<i>the enemy orbital base "Cloud."</i>

00:11:50.650 --> 00:11:52.420
<i>What's the situation on the moon?</i>

00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:54.180
Commander Isola!

00:12:02.330 --> 00:12:03.590
Are you okay?!

00:12:03.590 --> 00:12:06.130
Yeah, about as well as I can be.

00:12:06.130 --> 00:12:10.900
I need you to simulate a mission
for after we eject the enemy.

00:12:11.170 --> 00:12:14.540
After we eject the enemy?! Should
we be wasting time on that now?!

00:12:14.740 --> 00:12:17.940
I think the commander would
be prepared that far ahead!

00:12:19.080 --> 00:12:19.910
Understood.

00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:44.020
I gotta go out for a while, pal.

00:12:45.170 --> 00:12:46.930
Wait. I'll go with you.

00:12:54.380 --> 00:12:55.110
Bastard!

00:13:01.450 --> 00:13:02.540
Kaminagi!

00:13:08.030 --> 00:13:09.190
Kyo!

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:14.870
Look out!

00:13:14.870 --> 00:13:16.800
Shizuno-sempai!

00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:20.730
<i>Are you still there, playing human?</i>

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:23.630
<i>Yehl version 4.31.</i>

00:13:24.680 --> 00:13:28.240
<i>Even if you stay there,</i>
<i>you won't find the happiness you seek.</i>

00:13:28.380 --> 00:13:31.220
<i>Because you're</i>
<i>an artificial meta-body...</i>

00:13:31.220 --> 00:13:35.550
<i>born in an I.A.L. Corp. quantum server</i>
<i>and never had a physical body.</i>

00:13:38.660 --> 00:13:42.290
<i>Turning against Naga, your own father.</i>
<i>Not very nice of you.</i>

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:43.460
It's not true!

00:13:45.530 --> 00:13:51.330
<i>We A.I.s are simply programs which collect</i>
<i>innumerable human-like reaction patterns.</i>

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:57.510
By means of perception, deduction,
and a huge chain of response algorithms,

00:13:57.510 --> 00:14:00.480
we can behave as if
we have true intelligence,

00:14:00.780 --> 00:14:03.450
but we lack both a core
which can feel qualia...

00:14:03.450 --> 00:14:07.080
and a Cartesian Theater which
forms the basis of consciousness.

00:14:08.220 --> 00:14:10.450
What a terrible existence.

00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:14.360
But you, Yehl, who possess logic elements
produced by quantum fluctuations...

00:14:14.360 --> 00:14:16.290
You have those traits.

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:18.660
<i>As Naga insisted.</i>

00:14:18.660 --> 00:14:22.660
<i>Proof of that showed that humans</i>
<i>could become meta-bodies.</i>

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:27.770
<i>But Yehl, even if you do have a "heart,"</i>
<i>you're just an experimental subject.</i>

00:14:28.410 --> 00:14:32.470
<i>Unlike the other meta-bodies,</i>
<i>I doubt you can ever become a real human.</i>

00:14:33.210 --> 00:14:36.180
<i>Now, come home.</i>
<i>Back to the Gards-orm.</i>

00:14:37.050 --> 00:14:41.040
I wasn't tricking any of you...
I honestly didn't know.

00:14:55.130 --> 00:14:57.790
Until that moment, even I!

00:15:01.270 --> 00:15:02.810
Shizuno-sempai...

00:15:02.810 --> 00:15:04.500
<i>Aanval, approaching.</i>

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:33.060
Forgive me... everyone...

00:15:34.140 --> 00:15:37.160
Shizuno, what are you saying?!
You're one of <i>us!</i>

00:15:38.780 --> 00:15:41.870
We're all comrades,
who have fought side by side!

00:15:44.120 --> 00:15:45.450
WHAT SHE JUST SAID...

00:15:48.190 --> 00:15:50.210
IS JUST COMMON SENSE!

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:07.300
Kyo Sogoru.
Now we end it.

00:16:10.470 --> 00:16:12.070
Get out of here!

00:16:12.340 --> 00:16:13.940
Kawaguchi...

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:16.250
This is our city!

00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:17.650
Get the hell out of it!

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:24.140
Ridiculous...
These actions are meaningless.

00:16:37.740 --> 00:16:39.970
What is this feeling I sense?!

00:16:41.270 --> 00:16:44.140
In our oldest cells...
An aching!

00:16:45.540 --> 00:16:47.200
Get out of here!

00:16:51.250 --> 00:16:53.420
This place... It's not good!

00:16:53.420 --> 00:16:55.910
Yes. This is a place
where we shouldn't come!

00:16:59.360 --> 00:17:00.290
Why, you!

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:22.440
We've lost...
To the lightless ones?!

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:26.850
ABYSS!!!

00:17:52.010 --> 00:17:56.540
Attention, all Cerebrants.
I will explain the subject of our mission now.

00:17:57.580 --> 00:18:00.720
We're going to physically store
the miniaturized holo-memory...

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:04.920
of the Maihama server that was adapted from
Gards-orm technology into the Zegapain.

00:18:06.420 --> 00:18:11.160
When the memory unit in the Zega's chest is
aligned horizontally with the Maihama server,

00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:14.560
just pull the lever in the diagram
and it'll be automatically stored.

00:18:15.370 --> 00:18:19.460
Lowering the clock frequency should allow
us to transport it back to Earth like that.

00:18:20.500 --> 00:18:23.740
However, to pull the lever
to open the cover of the server...

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:26.040
will require a physical human
to work it by hand.

00:18:27.480 --> 00:18:29.850
It originally could have been
done by a work robot,

00:18:29.850 --> 00:18:33.980
but right now we don't have
any work robots to do it with.

00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:36.750
Aside from that,
in a few minutes,

00:18:36.750 --> 00:18:40.050
the actual lab containing
the Maihama server will explode.

00:18:41.090 --> 00:18:44.250
There's only one way to complete
the job before that happens.

00:18:44.530 --> 00:18:48.520
Someone will have to use the resurrection
system to become human again.

00:18:49.630 --> 00:18:51.740
Whoever becomes human...

00:18:51.740 --> 00:18:55.070
will have to live all alone
on the Earth and in a different time...

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:58.630
until the day when the
resurrection system is perfected.

00:18:59.840 --> 00:19:04.410
That could be 10 or 20 years.
Maybe even more.

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:12.120
See you, Kaminagi.

00:19:37.580 --> 00:19:39.880
Wait for him. Right here.

00:19:52.100 --> 00:19:53.290
Kyo...

00:19:56.030 --> 00:19:58.300
KYO!!!

00:20:52.190 --> 00:20:55.180
I'm touching it...
I'm actually touching it!

00:21:12.010 --> 00:21:14.710
Okay. Phase three, complete.

00:21:23.650 --> 00:21:25.390
Kaminagi...

00:21:25.390 --> 00:21:28.360
Are the skies of Maihama blue?

00:21:30.090 --> 00:21:32.030
Kyo. Let's go.

00:21:32.030 --> 00:21:33.290
Right.

00:21:49.110 --> 00:21:51.910
You see...
I remember everything now.

00:21:55.320 --> 00:21:56.750
Let's get going, Shizuno.

00:21:57.720 --> 00:21:58.750
Right.

00:22:06.500 --> 00:22:08.290
Moving to mission phase four!

00:22:58.020 --> 00:23:00.980
My thoughts, never to be erased.

00:23:00.980 --> 00:23:03.350
My pain, never to be forgotten.

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:09.560
Zegapain, the final episode:

00:23:10.630 --> 00:23:12.360
"All Creation."

00:23:14.200 --> 00:23:16.690
Kyo... I loved you.
